      "numerical_answer": 10,
      "numerical_tolerance": 0.01,
      "marks": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "explanation": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "value": "Let $r$ be the number of rows. $r(r + 4) = 140 \\implies r^2 + 4r - 140 = 0 \\implies (r + 14)(r - 10) = 0 \\implies r = 10$."
